prefix(scope): Title (< 50 characters)
###################################################

Description (< 72 characters):
  - Description of change 1 in `file_1.txt`
  - Description of change 2 in `file_2.txt`
######################################################################

Ref-Keyword: #ID

# Prefixes: feat, fix, refactor, test, style, docs, perf, build, chore, revert, merge.
# Summary: imperative mood, at most 50 characters.
# Ref-Keyword: Closes, Fixes or Refs, followed by the issue number; delete the line if none.
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored by git.
